    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 24 ('Floren Forest (the live dungeon: corrupted floren and twisted serpents from the '): scene sg_floren_forest, 4 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Blighted Floren last; every spot is the fork's."
